{"id":"1260957591485575168","date":"2020-05-14","url":"https://x.com/nickaturley/status/1260957591485575168","text":"The electronic calendar UX encourages us to book 1:1 meetings in 30 min increments. How much time is wasted due to the (natural) instinct to fill the available time? Is the predictability you get from scheduling blocks of time worth it or are old fashioned ad hoc calls superior?","deleted":true,"live_status":410,"archived_at":"20200514224846","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200514224846/https://twitter.com/nickaturley/status/1260957591485575168","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
